      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SWANKY CHIC (5) jumped from a squeeze box but quickly into stride and led until late to place second and beaten a long neck (22.78) at Ballarat in a Grade 5 over 390m. The form out of her last race has been franked. Rates highly and will give a great sight. FAWN BEAST (2) turned spotting a big start finishing sixth (22.94) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Form at the trip sound including eight wins. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. WEST TWO AFFAIR (1) turned in a moderate run last time when sixth at this track over 390m behind Tipsy Tilly (23.32) in a Grade 5. The form from her last run stacks up well. Can measure up this time. HARTLAND BUSTER (4) has to be respected despite coming off a three-and-a-half months break.",
